  "在内置样式之后加载你自己的 CSS，保存后所有窗口立即生效，不用重启；应用更新不会覆盖它。改坏了就在这里关掉。": "Loads your own CSS after the built-in styles. Save it and every window updates at once, no restart; app updates don't overwrite it. If it breaks something, switch it off here.",
  "在内置浏览器打开链接": "Open links in the built-in browser",
  "在内置浏览器里，Agent 打开这些网站、在上面点击、输入、填表都不再问你；不在这里的网站，第一次打开或操作时问你一次。在页面里运行脚本仍然每次都问。完全放开时都不问。「*.」开头的包括它的子域名。": "In the built-in browser, the Agent opens these sites and clicks, types and fills in forms on them without asking you; a site not listed here is asked about once, the first time it is opened or acted on. Running a script in a page is still asked about every time. In Full access nothing is asked. An entry starting with \"*.\" includes its subdomains.",
