  "这个对话和它的改动（包括还没提交的）会推到项目远端的一个新分支，常开机器在那里接着做。你本地的分支、暂存区和文件都不会动。": "This conversation and its changes (uncommitted ones too) go to a new branch on the project's remote, and the always-on machine carries on from there. Your local branch, index and files stay untouched.",
  "这个对话在仓库的一个独立副本（git worktree）里运行，不是主检出": "This conversation runs in a separate copy (git worktree) of the repository, not the main checkout",
  "这个对话在机器「{name}」上（目录 {cwd}），那里的路径在本机多半不存在。会新建一个本机对话，带上一份交接说明；原对话保持不变。": "This conversation is on computer “{name}” (folder {cwd}), and that path most likely doesn't exist on this computer. A new conversation will be created here with a handoff note; the original stays unchanged.",
  "这个对话在机器「{name}」上，它的仓库在那台机器上。": "This conversation is on computer “{name}”, and its repository is on that computer.",
  "这个对话在机器「{name}」上，它的改动要在那台机器上审阅。": "This conversation is on the machine “{name}”. Review its changes on that machine.",
  "这个对话在机器「{name}」上，它的文件 / Git / 搜索 / 定时任务都在那台机器上。": "This conversation is on the machine “{name}”. Its files, Git, search and scheduled tasks are all on that machine.",
  "这个对话在机器「{name}」上，它的文件在那台机器上。": "This conversation is on computer “{name}”, and its files are on that computer.",
  "这个对话在跑的时候不让电脑睡眠（屏幕照常会关）": "Don't let the computer sleep while this conversation is running (the screen still turns off)",
