  "这个对话用的是 Claude 账号，但它还没登录。接一个模型，这个对话就换过去并重试刚才那条消息。": "This conversation uses your Claude account, but you're not logged in. Connect a model, and this conversation switches to it and retries your last message.",
  "这个对话用的是「Claude 账号」，没有经过你添加的供应商（中转）。要用供应商：点输入框右下角的模型按钮，在供应商那一节选一个模型。{why}": "This conversation uses the “Claude account”, not a provider (relay) you added. To use a provider: click the model button at the bottom right of the input box and pick a model in the providers section. {why}",
  "这个对话用的是「Claude 账号」，没有经过你添加的供应商（中转）：被拒的是 Claude 账号的登录，或者 ~/.claude/settings.json 里写的 Key。要用供应商：点输入框右下角的模型按钮，在供应商那一节选一个模型。": "This conversation uses the “Claude account”, not a provider (relay) you added: what was rejected is the Claude account login, or the key written in ~/.claude/settings.json. To use a provider: click the model button at the bottom right of the input box and pick a model in the providers section.",
  "这个对话的 agent 不提供明细": "This conversation's agent doesn't report details",
  "这个对话的更多操作：导出、步骤视图、改动 / Git / 文件…、重命名、分叉、归档、删除": "More actions for this conversation: export, Steps view, changes / Git / files…, rename, fork, archive, delete",
  "这个对话的权限是「{label}」，已更新显示，请再发一次": "This conversation's permission is \"{label}\". The chip now shows it; please send again.",
  "这个对话的记录里有接口不收的内容（只发一张图片时留下的空文字，或别家模型的思考），已经自动去掉了：点重试或再发一次就行。": "This conversation's history held something the API refuses (an empty text left by sending a picture on its own, or another vendor's model's thinking). It has been taken out: click Retry or send again.",
  "这个对话的进程已经不在运行了（可能已被关闭，或服务重启过），这一轮已结束。直接发送新消息会重新接上。": "This conversation's process is no longer running (it may have been closed, or the service restarted), so this turn has ended. Sending a new message will reconnect it.",
