  "这个服务不接受你所在地区的直连请求。开着梯子的话，看 {PROXY_SETTING_PATH} 是否显示在用它；没开就先开梯子再试。": "This service doesn't accept direct requests from your region. If you use a proxy, check whether {PROXY_SETTING_PATH} shows it in use; if not, turn it on and try again.",
