  "这个节点的活已经做完、只是没合并进去：处理冲突后点「重新合并」就够了（或手动 git merge 它的分支），不必整个重跑。": "This node's work is already done and just wasn't merged in: after resolving the conflict, click “Merge again” (or run git merge on its branch yourself); there's no need to rerun the whole thing.",
