  "这台机器一直开着：可以把对话交给它继续，合上本机也不停": "This machine stays on: hand conversations to it and they keep going while this one is closed",
  "这台电脑上由这个应用开的每个对话和终端都会带上，加密保存在本机。改了之后新开的对话和终端生效。选模型 / 账号的变量（ANTHROPIC_… 等）由供应商决定，这里不收。": "Every conversation and terminal this app starts on this computer gets these. They're stored encrypted on this computer. Changes apply to conversations and terminals started afterwards. Variables that choose the model or account (ANTHROPIC_… etc.) are set by the provider and aren't accepted here.",
  "这台电脑的系统没有可下载的运行库，本地模型用不了。": "There is no runtime to download for this computer's system, so the local model can't be used.",
  "这台电脑装了官方 Claude 桌面版的话，它为你的账号下载的技能（Excel、PDF、Word、PPT 等）在这里的对话里也能用，在官方 App 里开始的对话接着聊时不会再「Unknown skill」。改了之后新开的对话生效。": "If the official Claude desktop app is installed on this computer, the skills it downloaded for your account (Excel, PDF, Word, PowerPoint…) work in conversations here too, and a conversation started in the official app no longer says 「Unknown skill」 when you continue it here. Applies to conversations opened after the change.",
